<title>BELGIUM: BEFIMMO SELLS LAND PARCEL TO BERNHEIM - OUTREMER.</title>
<headline>BEFIMMO SELLS LAND PARCEL TO BERNHEIM - OUTREMER.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real estate fund Befimmo said on Monday it had sold a 1.64 hectare parcel of land in Kontich to property firm Bernheim-Outremer for more than 26.7 million francs.</p>
<p>The land, which includes a 90 acres industrial park for small and medium-sized businesses, lies behind number nine Prins Boudewijnlaan.</p>
<p>Befimmo noted that as of June 30, 1996 its property portfolio was worth 6.3 billion francs.</p>
